      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For Sale by Online Auction on Friday 25th September at 11am. To register to bid please go to: \r\nhttps://www.propertypartnersonlineauctions.ie/future-auctions \r\n\r\nPROPERTY PARTNERS OBRIEN SWAINE are delighted to present an exceptional opportunity to acquire this superbly located retail premises, just off the Main Street in the heart of Gorey Town. This impressive two-storey commercial building is in excellent condition throughout, having undergone extensive renovation in 2008. Boasting prime road frontage onto St. Michaels Road, the property enjoys high visibility and strong foot traffic, making it ideal for a wide range of commercial uses.\r\nThe accommodation comprises of a bright and spacious retail unit with excellent street presence on the ground floor with office space complete with kitchenette and bathroom facilities on the first floor. Ideally situated in one of the southeast's most vibrant trading towns, this property offers an outstanding opportunity for both owner-occupiers and investors. \r\n\r\nWith Gorey's continued commercial growth and high levels of passing trade, this is a smart acquisition in a highly sought-after location. Outstanding location just off Main Street Ber E1 Renovated in 2008 Excellent decorative condition Approx. 620 sq ft in total \r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended (by appointment only)"
